GC_LobbyGameMode : "{A79C4E0A43DEB821}Prefabs/MP/Modes/GC_LobbyGameMode.et" {
 ID "F52F19C38BBC58BA"
 components {
  GC_LobbyManager "{6A137A39106A4973}" {
   m_aBriefings {
    GC_Briefing "{7B029A38A839FEBE}" {
     m_iOrder 0
     m_sTitle "Situation"
     m_sContent "During a recent raid, a couple of our party members were injured and ultimately captured by the British pigs. We can only assume that they will figure out where our camp is and begin their attack."\
     ""\
     "<h2>Enemy Forces</h2>"\
     "The British don't mess around. They will probably send special forces with air support to assault our position. Our guess is a platoon's worth of infantry will take part in the assault and two littlebird helicopters will be flying around."\
     ""\
     "<h2>Friendly Forces</h2>"\
     "You know what you got. You have some spare iglas lying around that should help against the little birds. Beyond that, you got what you got (unless you find something out in the wild...)"
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_SEPARATIST"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{7FFBFC4D8EC04EC4}" {
     m_iOrder 1
     m_sTitle "Situation"
     m_sContent "A few hours ago, we captured to separatists that gave up the location of a local camp / cache. We are being deployed to secure the area and destroy the cache."\
     ""\
     "<h2>Enemy Forces</h2>"\
     "A reduced platoon of separatist fighers has been spotted on ISR. They are located in the red area, but it is extremely difficult to tract them; S2 believes that there are some underground systems within the area so keep a close eye out. They most likely have some sort of AA threat, though the exact count is unclear."\
     ""\
     "<h2>Friendly Forces</h2>"\
     "We have gathered all the ground forces at ORP. We have 1 unarmed JLTV for each team to move around in. You also have two AH-6 littlebirds assigned as close air support."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "UK"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{AE788002DC1B63EB}" {
     m_iOrder 2
     m_sTitle "Mission"
     m_sContent "Defend the area from the British assholes. Keep our supplies intact during their assault, but don't waste your life for unspent bullets."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_SEPARATIST"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{22EBB44185345218}" {
     m_iOrder 3
     m_sTitle "Mission"
     m_sContent "Your task force is to secure the area indicated in red from separatist forces. Additionally, destroy the supply cache located on site."\
     ""\
     "Platoon Leader has execution decision authority."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "UK"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{A92896B89DED05CA}" {
     m_iOrder 4
     m_sTitle "Service Support"
     m_sContent "There are two tripod HMGs defending the supplies if you need them. As mentioned before, there are also four Iglas laying around at the supply point. This area is also an old battlefield from WW2, so you may find some interesting things lying around; if it works, don't be afraid to use it."\
     ""\
     "Callsigns per the group leader. Radio frequencies are preset."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_SEPARATIST"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{7DA6DE4E765AF4DA}" {
     m_iOrder 5
     m_sTitle "Service Support Command and Signal"
     m_sContent "<h2>Service</h2>"\
     "Littlebirds have rearm, refuel, and repair support located at the air-base."\
     ""\
     "Infantry do not have any further support than what is provided."\
     ""\
     "<h2>Support</h2>"\
     "Nothing past the littlebirds are available for this mission."\
     ""\
     "<h2>Command and Signal</h2>"\
     "Ground Net: 48.0 Mhz"\
     "Air Net: 48.5 Mhz"\
     "Team nets: As determined in the field."\
     ""\
     "Ground Callsigns:"\
     "Spear 2: Platoon Leader"\
     "Spear 2'A - 2'F: Squads"\
     "Spear 2'R - RTO / FAC"\
     ""\
     "Bird 6'1 & Bird 6'2 - Littlebird Flight"
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "UK"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{08B6063C168A3281}" {
     m_iOrder 6
     m_sTitle "End Conditions"
     m_sContent "British Victory: 95% of separatists killed and cache destroyed."\
     "Separatist Major Victory: 90% of british killed and cache remains."\
     "Separatist Minor Victory: 90% of british killed but cache destroyed."\
     ""\
     "The cache does not take a lot to blow up, and it will chain react."
     m_eAudience 2
    }
    GC_Briefing "{6809CA0BC634B4AE}" {
     m_iOrder 7
     m_sTitle "Overview"
     m_sContent "U.K. Special Forces seize Separatist supply point and surrounding camp."\
     ""\
     "Random weather, start time, and forecasted weather. British CO can change time if too dark, no change in weather."
    }
   }
  }
 }
}
